  "description": "Voodoo Bizango Pro\n\nThe Voodoo Bizango Pro is designed for riders who demand precision, power, and versatility on the trail. Whether you're climbing steep hills or tackling technical descents, this hardtail MTB delivers the perfect balance of stability and speed.\n\nWhy Choose the Bizango Pro?\n\nProvides exceptional control and confidence without feeling too aggressive.\n\n130mm of smooth travel ensures a stable, responsive ride on rough terrain.\n\nLighter than lower-spec drivetrains, with a 10-51T cassette for seamless shifting and efficient power transfer.\n\nTubeless-ready with a fast-rolling tread pattern, delivering better cornering stability and braking power.\n\nA WTB Volt saddle, 6061 alloy handlebars, and a short 45mm stem enhance comfort and control on long rides.\n\nBuilt to take on the UK's toughest trails, the Bizango Pro is a next-level upgrade of the award-winning Bizango!\n\nWith a fully redesigned frame featuring trail-ready geometry that offers slack seat and headtube angles for improved control and enhanced comfort, it delivers unmatched confidence across all terrains.\n\nUpgraded with front and rear thru-axles, UDH hanger compatibility, a new handlebar shape, and the latest Shimano CUES groupset, the Bizango Pro is built to handle whatever you throw at it.",
